(24398: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20Translates%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20between%20JavaScript%2C%20TypeScript%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20Rust%20through%20meta-language%20links.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20The%20source%20is%20parsed%20losslessly%20with%20its%20default%20grammar%3B%20a%20translation%0A%2F%2F%21%20into%20the%20same%20language%20writes%20the%20links%20back%20byte%20for%20byte%2C%20and%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20translation%20into%20the%20other%20language%20translates%20each%20top-level%20item%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20portable%20core%20can%20express%20and%20carries%20every%20other%20item%20verbatim%20in%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20marked%20comment.%20Both%20kinds%20of%20item%20keep%20their%20source%20as%20provenance%2C%20so%0A%2F%2F%21%20translating%20an%20unedited%20translation%20back%20restores%20the%20source%20byte%20for%0A%2F%2F%21%20byte.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Afrontend_rules%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20accept_source_envelope_restoration%2C%20accept_source_prefix_restoration%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3ASExpr%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3ABTreeMap%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3A%3AWrite%20as%20_%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Async%3A%3ALazyLock%3B%0A%0Ause%20regex%3A%3ARegex%3B%0Ause%20sha2%3A%3A%7BDigest%2C%20Sha256%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Adecorators%3A%3ADecoratorSet%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Agrammar%3A%3Adecorate_emitted%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3AExternal%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3A%7BLinkNetwork%2C%20ParseConfiguration%7D%3B%0A%0Amod%20binding%3B%0Amod%20emission%3B%0Apub%20mod%20representation%3B%0Amod%20representation_rules%3B%0Ause%20emission%3A%3Aemit_item%3B%0Ause%20representation%3A%3AContext%3B%0Amod%20scope%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure_rules%3B%0Amod%20typescript_portable_typing%3B%0Ause%20scope%3A%3Atranslate_binding_groups%3B%0A%0Ause%20self%3A%3Abinding%3A%3ABinder%3B%0Ause%20typescript_erasure%3A%3Arequires_type_script_erasure%3B%0Apub%20use%20typescript_erasure%3A%3A%7BErasedTypeScript%2C%20Erasure%2C%20erase_type_script%7D%3B%0Apub%20use%20typescript_portable_typing%3A%3Aproject_type_script_typing%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20The%20signature%20of%20an%20exported%20item%20of%20a%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20module.%0A%2F%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%2F%20It%20binds%20the%20name%20a%20module%20that%20imports%20it%20uses%3A%20a%20function%27s%20parameters%0A%2F%2F%2F%20and%20result%2C%20or%20a%20constant%27s%20type%20and%20whether%20a%20literal%20gives%20its%20value.%0Apub%20type%20SelfTranslationSignature%20%3D%20External%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20What%20%5B%60self_translate_with%60%5D%20translates%20a%20module%20with.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%2C%20Default%2C%20PartialEq%2C%20Eq%29%5D%0Apub%20struct%20SelfTranslationOptions%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20emitter%20decorators%2C%20as%20%5B%60self_translate_decorated%60%5D%20applies%20them.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20decorators%3A%20DecoratorSet%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20module%27s%20directory%20inside%20its%20crate%2C%20as%20path%20segments%3A%20the%20crate%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20root%20when%20empty.%20A%20relative%20import%20becomes%20a%20%60use%20crate%3A%3A%E2%80%A6%60%20of%20the%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20module%20it%20names%20from%20there.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20module_directory%3A%20Vec%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20signatures%20%5B%60self_translation_signatures%60%5D%20gives%20for%20each%20module%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20the%20module%20imports%2C%20by%20import%20specifier%2C%20which%20bind%20the%20imported%20names.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20imports%3A%20BTreeMap%3CString%2C%20Vec%3CSelfTranslationSignature%3E%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Select%20the%20shared%20UTF16%20prelude%20and%20paired%20Text%20lowering%3B%20unsupported%20emissions%20are%20carried.%0A%20%20%20%20