%27%2C%27floating%20point%27%2C%27unsigned%20integer%27%2C%27%27%2C%27signed%20integer%27%2C%27%27%2C%27unsigned%20integer%27%2C%27%27%5D%3B%0A%20%20const%20cases%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20for%28const%20profileAvailable%20of%20%5Bfalse%2Ctrue%5D%29for%28const%20version%20of%20%5B%27%27%2C%20%271.0.150%27%2C%271.0.151%27%2C%271.0.152%27%2C%271.0.151-extra%27%5D%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%20arbitraryPrecision%20of%20%5Bfalse%2Ctrue%5D%29for%28let%20flags%3D0%3Bflags%3C8%3Bflags%2B%2B%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20cases.push%28%7BprofileAvailable%2Cversion%2CarbitraryPrecision%2Csigned%3ABoolean%28flags%264%29%2Cunsigned%3ABoolean%28flags%262%29%2Cfloating%3ABoolean%28flags%261%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20expected%3AprofileAvailable%26%26version%3D%3D%3D%271.0.151%27%26%26%21arbitraryPrecision%3Fmeanings%5Bflags%5D%3A%27%27%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20const%20fixture%3D%7BschemaVersion%3A1%2Csource%3A%27experiments%2Fgrammar-outcome-network%2Fnative-transport%2Finverse%2Fnumber-kind-rules.mjs%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20sourceSha256%3AcreateHash%28%27sha256%27%29.update%28source%29.digest%28%27hex%27%29%2Cdeclarations%2C%0A%20%20%20%20model%3A%7Bdependency%3A%27serde_json%27%2CversionRange%3A%27%3E%3D1.0.151%20%3C1.0.152%27%2CexcludedFeature%3A%27arbitrary_precision%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20predicates%3A%5B%27is_i64%27%2C%27is_u64%27%2C%27is_f64%27%5D%2Cauthority%3A%27https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.rs%2Fserde_json%2F1.0.151%2Fsrc%2Fserde_json%2Fnumber.rs.html%27%7D%2Ccases%2C%0A%20%20%20%20boundary%3A%27A%20complete%20predicate%20selector%20under%20an%20explicitly%20authenticated%20linked%20dependency%20profile.%20These%20synthetic%20control%20inputs%20are%20not%20an%20actual%20compiler%20feature%20attestation%20or%20original%20number%20observation.%20Unknown%20profiles%20and%20contradictory%20predicates%20refuse.%20Exact%20payloads%2C%20source%20occurrence%20ownership%20and%20complete%20native%20DTO%20reconstruction%20remain%20separate%20obligations.%20Native%20executi